<div class="content-area mx-auto py-8">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Glossary of Mycology Terms</h1>

  <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-6 mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900">How to Use This Glossary</h2>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
      <p>
        This page is designed as a study reference for readers exploring fungal biology, taxonomy, and field identification.
        The list below is organized for fast scanning so you can quickly compare terms while reading scientific or educational text.
      </p>
      <p>
        Click any term to open the full definition and use the demo page to see how Auto-Glossary can annotate technical writing in context.
        We keep source attribution visible and pair it with implementation guidance so developers can apply these terms in real applications.
      </p>
      <p>
        For best results, start with morphology terms such as <em>pileus</em>, <em>stipe</em>, and <em>hymenium</em>, then move to lifecycle terms
        like <em>basidium</em> and <em>spore</em> to build a practical learning path from structure to function.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
      Browse all <%= @terms.size %> terms from Wikipedia's Glossary of Mycology.
      Click any term to see its full definition.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <% @terms.each do |term, definition| %>
        <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded p-4 hover:shadow-md transition">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 capitalize">
            <%= term %>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
            <%= truncate(definition, length: 150) %>
          </p>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="text-center">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
      Source: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glossary_of_mycology" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Wikipedia Glossary of Mycology</a> (CC BY-SA 4.0)
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
      <a href="/privacy" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Privacy Policy</a>
    </p>
    <a href="/demo" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-semibold">← Back to Demo</a>
  </div>

</div>
